A not entirely frivolous suggestion is:

 1) Learn emacs.  
 2) Install ESS (Emacs Speaks Statistics).  (see http://ess.stat.wisc.edu/)
 3) Put your code in an ESS buffer in S-mode.
 4) Mark the region and use M-x comment-region.

